; mh_net.def -- mh_net.dll's EXPORT LIST (fork F4B).
;
; A .def rather than __declspec(dllexport) on each function, for three reasons that are all about
; the split rather than about style:
;
;   1. The list is the CONTRACT, and a contract wants to be one readable file. mh.dll resolves every
;      name below with GetProcAddress (never an import library -- see 3), so this file and
;      mh_common/include/mh_net_module.h's MH_NET_MODULE_SYMBOLS table are the two halves of one
;      statement. tools/check_module_bind.py --net-surface asserts they agree, in both directions,
;      so a symbol added to one and forgotten in the other is a red rather than a null call.
;   2. It exports the transport WITHOUT touching net_transport.cpp's declarations. That file is also
;      compiled directly into net_selftest.exe, where dllexport would be wrong; keeping the export
;      decision in the link rather than in the source is what lets one TU serve both.
;   3. No import library is produced for anyone to link by accident. A single `mh_net.lib` on some
;      future link line would put mh_net.dll in that module's IMPORT TABLE, and a missing file would
;      then fail PROCESS LOAD before one instruction of ours ran -- measured at F4A (0xC0000135,
;      zero log directories). Absent-tolerance is the whole point of the item; making it impossible
;      to link against is cheap insurance.
;
; ORDER MATCHES MH_NET_MODULE_SYMBOLS in mh_net_module.h (the 26 bound symbols), then the two
; module-level entries that are not part of the transport API. Names are undecorated: everything
; here is `extern "C"` __cdecl, so the linker matches these against the leading-underscore forms.
;
; NOT HERE, AND THAT IS THE POINT: MH_Net_Init and MH_Net_Shutdown. Both had zero call sites in the
; whole tree (measured at F4B), and fork F4B deleted them -- see the note where they used to live in
; net_transport.cpp. MH_Key_Random is not here either: it is the transport's own CSPRNG entry and
; has no caller outside this module.
LIBRARY mh_net
EXPORTS
    MH_Net_InitEx
    MH_Net_Send
    MH_Net_Recv
    MH_Net_PeerCount
    MH_Net_LocalPlayerId
    MH_Net_IdAssigned
    MH_Net_ActivePeerIds
    MH_Net_TakeDeadPeer
    MH_Net_IsStarted
    MH_Net_GetStats
    MH_Net_SetSessionInfoHandler
    MH_Net_SendSessionInfo
    MH_Net_SetJoinHandler
    MH_Net_SendJoin
    MH_Net_SetStartHandler
    MH_Net_SendStart
    MH_Net_SetLeaveHandler
    MH_Net_SendLeave
    MH_Net_SetAnnounceHandler
    MH_Net_SendAnnounce
    MH_Net_SetHashHandler
    MH_Net_SendHash
    MH_Key_Load
    MH_Net_SnapshotSend
    MH_Net_SnapshotPoll
    MH_Net_SnapshotStatus
    MH_NetModule_Init
    MH_NetModule_Probe
